  "title": "Qt: Make IOConsoleDialog a single instance",
  "description": "When opening a console dialog, make it reuse an existing instance\nif it is already open. This is required because the output of\nthe lua code currently only goes into a single GUI dialog.\nAnd in general it feels correct.\n\nThis dependens on the QAction holding the pointer reference,\nwhich seems reasonable because it is a dynamic menu action.",
